  "title": "SpaceX Lenders Concern Over Chip Collateral",
  "summary": "SpaceX is facing concerns from investors who fear that launching their valuable chip collateral into space could disrupt the financial stability of the company. Elon Musk is urged to ensure that the collateral remains accessible and secure for future development.",
